		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MEMENTO_EDWARD_TEACH_FIGUREHEAD_OF_QUEEN_ANNES_REVENGE_UNLOCK_TITLE">
			<Text>Unlock at Edward Teach level 9</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MEMENTO_EDWARD_TEACH_BRACE_OF_PISTOLS_NAME">
			<Text>Brace of Pistols</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MEMENTO_EDWARD_TEACH_BRACE_OF_PISTOLS_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>Let the battle commence.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MEMENTO_EDWARD_TEACH_BRACE_OF_PISTOLS_FUNCTIONAL_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>[B]+2 [icon:NAR_REW_COMBAT][/B] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_COMBAT_STRENGTH_TOOLTIP]Combat Strength[/TIP] for [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_NAVAL_UNITS_TOOLTIP]Naval Units[/TIP] while attacking.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MEMENTO_EDWARD_TEACH_BRACE_OF_PISTOLS_PREVIEW">
			<Text>+2 Brace of Pistols</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MEMENTO_EDWARD_TEACH_MEDICINE_CHEST_NAME">
			<Text>Medicine Chest</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MEMENTO_EDWARD_TEACH_MEDICINE_CHEST_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>A cure for all ailments.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MEMENTO_EDWARD_TEACH_MEDICINE_CHEST_FUNCTIONAL_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>+5 Healing for [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_NAVAL_UNITS_TOOLTIP]Naval Units[/TIP].</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MEMENTO_EDWARD_TEACH_FIGUREHEAD_OF_QUEEN_ANNES_REVENGE_NAME">
			<Text>Figurehead of the Queen Anne's Revenge</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MEMENTO_EDWARD_TEACH_FIGUREHEAD_OF_QUEEN_ANNES_REVENGE_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>Soaring the seas.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MEMENTO_EDWARD_TEACH_FIGUREHEAD_OF_QUEEN_ANNES_REVENGE_FUNCTIONAL_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>Defeating any Naval Unit grants [icon:YIELD_GOLD] equal to 25% of its [icon:NAR_REW_COMBAT] [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_COMBAT_STRENGTH_TOOLTIP]Combat Strength[/TIP].</Text>
		</Row>
